{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrYIMQT1nYtwJHttdJH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to lay out what it takes to build a FoodWagon-style delivery landing page in Figma using the supplied media library. The page frame is 1920 wide with a 1320 content column (x=300 to 1620), and the media symbols live in page 1:4, so I can create instances of them on my workspace page as long as everything stays in the same file. I set the tokens: primary #F17228, secondary #FFB30E, ink #1A1A1F, ink-2 #4E4E57, muted #7A7A85, border #EAEAEE, cream #FFF6EC, footer #1F1F26, open-green #2FA84F.\n\nThe page splits into 12 sections. The header is 96 tall, white with a #F0F0F2 bottom rule: logo instance at 200x37, a divider at x=540, then \"Deliver to:\" with a map-pin icon at 18px, \"Current Location\" bold at 15 and the address at 14 muted. The search pill sits at x=900, 420x48, holding Icon_Search at 20 plus \"Search Food\" at 15, and the Login button with Icon_User anchors the right edge.\n\nThe hero is 1920x620: Photo_Hero_Background resized and set to FILL so it crops, an orange-to-secondary gradient overlay at 0.95 to 0.35, and a second dark overlay at 0.35 for contrast. The headline sits at y=96, white 56 bold, with the subtitle beneath, and the white search card (radius 28, 880 wide) at y=300 carries a Delivery tab in active state and Pickup as the inactive variant, an address field with a map marker, and the orange \"Find Food\" button. The noodles image is decorative bottom right.\n\nSection math: 5 popular-item cards at 244 wide with 24 gaps gives 1320; the deals blocks are 419 wide ((1320-2*32)/3); 6 category tiles at 200 wide with 5x24 gaps totals 1320; featured restaurants are 4 columns of 312 with 3x24 gaps, two rows to show all 8; discounts are 4 cards at 312 wide and 220 tall with a percentage, dish name and \"6 Days Remaining\". The how-it-works row is 4 steps with icons in tinted circles, and the features strip is a #FFF2E5 band with 3 items.\n\nThe card photos use imageHash fills pulled from the same media bytes, while fixed imagery (hero, CTA, app mockup, store badges, social logos, logo, icons) uses real instances. Icon recoloring works by walking the instance descendants and setting fills, which creates overrides. Fonts are Source Sans Pro at Regular, SemiBold and Bold, loaded before any text node is created. Section heights accumulate to roughly 6000. The brief asks for no prototype, so I keep hover and focus variants on the master components and skip wiring.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":33325,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":33325}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"8a222991-e2a3-417c-9f14-f9f95098b2a9","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:40:11.901Z","thinking_duration_ms":59323}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrYIMQT1nYtwJHttdJH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything I need is loaded: 66 media components plus default Button/Text Field. I'll build the page in sections, starting with the header and hero."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":33325,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":33325}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"ff6d45b4-c43b-43ac-ac3b-cfcf81ee24cd","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:40:12.677Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrYIMQT1nYtwJHttdJH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ZlPRfeCy8aTseE0kQNPveE","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"NE4meAES0ToaWiR2n9eVVf","description":"Set up workspace page, fonts, main frame, header and hero","code":"\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('11:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n\nconst FONTS = {};\nasync function fonts(){\n  const list = [['Regular','Regular'],['SemiBold','SemiBold'],['Bold','Bold'],['Light','Light'],['Italic','Italic']];\n  for (const [k,style] of list){\n    try { await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Source Sans Pro', style}); FONTS[k]=style; }\n    catch(e){ try{ await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Source Sans Pro', style:'Regular'}); FONTS[k]='Regular'; }catch(e2){} }\n  }\n  return Object.keys(FONTS);\n}\nconst loaded = await fonts();\n\nconst C = {\n  primary:'#F17228', primaryDark:'#D95F19', secondary:'#FFB30E',\n  ink:'#1A1A1F', ink2:'#4E4E57', muted:'#8A8A94', line:'#EFEFF2',\n  cream:'#FFF6EC', cream2:'#FFF2E5', footer:'#1F1F26', green:'#2E9E4F', white:'#FFFFFF'\n};\n\nfunction solid(hex, opacity){\n  const h=hex.replace('#',''); const n=parseInt(h,16);\n  const f={type:'SOLID', color:{r:((n>>16)&255)/255, g:((n>>8)&255)/255, b:(n&255)/255}};\n  if(opacity!==undefined) f.opacity=opacity;\n  return f;\n}\nfunction rect(parent,name,x,y,w,h,hex,r){\n  const n=figma.createRectangle(); n.name=name; n.resize(w,h); parent.appendChild(n);\n  n.x=x; n.y=y; if(hex) n.fills=[solid(hex)]; if(r) n.cornerRadius=r;\n  return n;\n}\nfunction frame(parent,name,x,y,w,h,hex,r,clip){\n  const n=figma.createFrame(); n.name=name; n.resize(w,h); parent.appendChild(n);\n  n.x=x; n.y=y; n.fills = hex? [solid(hex)] : []; if(r) n.cornerRadius=r;\n  if(clip!==false) n.clipsContent = true;\n  return n;\n}\nfunction txt(parent,name,chars,x,y,w,opt){\n  opt=opt||{};\n  const n=figma.createText(); n.name=name; n.fontFamily='Source Sans Pro';\n  n.fontName={family:'Source Sans Pro', style: FONTS[opt.weight||'Regular']||'Regular'};\n  n.fontSize = opt.size||16;\n  n.characters = chars;\n  parent.appendChild(n);\n  n.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; n.resize(w, Math.max(1,n.height));\n  n.x=x; n.y=y;\n  n.fills = [solid(opt.color||C.ink)];\n  n.lineHeight = {unit:'PIXELS', value: opt.lh|| Math.round((opt.size||16)*1.45)};\n  if(opt.letterSpacing) n.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS', value:opt.letterSpacing};\n  if(opt.align) n.textAlignHorizontal=opt.align;\n  return n;\n}\nconst mediaCache = {};\nasync function media(id){ if(!mediaCache[id]) mediaCache[id]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id); return mediaCache[id]; }\nasync function mediaInstance(parent, compId, x,y,w,h, name){\n  const comp = await media(compId);\n  const inst = comp.createInstance();\n  parent.appendChild(inst);\n  inst.resize(w,h);\n  inst.x=x; inst.y=y;\n  if(name) inst.name=name;\n  return inst;\n}\nfunction recolor(node, hex){\n  const f=[solid(hex)];\n  if(node.fills && node.fills.length) node.fills=f;\n  if(node.children) node.children.forEach(c=>recolor(c,hex));\n}\nasync function icon(parent, compId, x,y,size,hex){\n  const inst = await mediaInstance(parent, compId, x,y,size,size);\n  try{ recolor(inst, hex); }catch(e){}\n  return inst;\n}\n\n// ---------- main page frame ----------\nconst home = frame(page, '01_Home', 0, 0, 1920, 6000, C.white, 0, false);\nhome.x=0; home.y=0;\n\n// ---------- HEADER ----------\nconst header = frame(home,'Header',0,0,1920,96,C.white,0,true);\nrect(header,'Header border',0,95,1920,1,C.line);\nawait mediaInstance(header,'9:27', 300, 29, 200, 37, 'Logo_FoodWagon');\n\nrect(header,'Divider', 540, 30, 1, 36, '#E6E6EA');\nawait icon(header,'9:9', 568, 38, 20, C.primary);\ntxt(header,'Deliver to:','Deliver to:', 596, 29, 200,{size:11,weight:'Bold',color:C.muted,lh:14,letterSpacing:0.6});\n// uppercase via characters\nconst dt = header.findOne(n=>n.name==='Deliver to:'); dt.characters='DELIVER TO:';\ntxt(header,'Current Location','Current Location', 596, 45, 200,{size:15,weight:'Bold',color:C.ink,lh:19});\ntxt(header,'Address','Mohammadpur Bus Stand, Dhaka', 596, 65, 300,{size:13,color:C.muted,lh:16});\n\nconst searchPill = frame(header,'Header Search', 1046, 24, 380, 48, '#F5F5F7', 24, true);\nawait icon(searchPill,'9:12', 18, 14, 20, C.muted);\ntxt(searchPill,'Search Food','Search Food', 48, 13, 300,{size:15,color:C.muted,lh:22});\n\nconst login = frame(header,'Login button', 1480, 24, 140, 48, C.white, 24, true);\nlogin.strokes=[solid(C.primary)]; login.strokeWeight=1.5; login.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nawait icon(login,'9:21', 22, 14, 20, C.primary);\ntxt(login,'Login label','Login', 50, 13, 90,{size:15,weight:'Bold',color:C.primary,lh:22});\n\n// ---------- HERO ----------\nconst hero = frame(home,'Hero',0,96,1920,680,null,0,true);\nawait mediaInstance(hero,'9:55', 0, 0, 1920, 680, 'Photo_Hero_Background');\nconst heroOverlay = rect(hero,'Hero overlay',0,0,1920,680,null,0);\nheroOverlay.fills=[{\n  type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR',\n  gradientTransform:[[0.94,0.42,-0.1],[0.42,0.94,-0.0]],\n  gradientStops:[\n    {position:0,color:{r:0.11,g:0.07,b:0.05,a:0.9}},\n    {position:0.45,color:{r:0.38,g:0.16,b:0.04,a:0.72}},\n    {position:1,color:{r:0.94,g:0.56,b:0.06,a:0.35}}\n  ]\n}];\n\ntxt(hero,'Hero eyebrow','FOOD DELIVERY, MADE DELICIOUS', 300, 92, 700,{size:13,weight:'Bold',color:'#FFD9A8',lh:18,letterSpacing:2});\ntxt(hero,'Hero title','Are you starving?', 300, 122, 900,{size:68,weight:'Bold',color:C.white,lh:78});\ntxt(hero,'Hero sub','Within a few clicks, find meals that are accessible near you', 300, 208, 620,{size:20,color:'#FFF3E6',lh:30});\n\nawait mediaInstance(hero,'9:39', 1330, 210, 420, 420, 'Photo_Hero_Noodles');\n\nconst card = frame(hero,'Hero search card', 300, 300, 860, 216, C.white, 24, true);\ncard.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW', color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.18}, offset:{x:0,y:18}, radius:40, spread:0, visible:true, blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n\n// tabs\nconst tabs = frame(card,'Tabs', 32, 32, 400, 48, '#F5F5F7', 12, true);\nconst tabActive = frame(tabs,'Tab · Delivery · current', 4, 4, 190, 40, C.white, 10, true);\ntabActive.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.10},offset:{x:0,y:2},radius:6,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\nawait icon(tabActive,'9:10', 20, 10, 20, C.primary);\ntxt(tabActive,'Delivery label','Delivery', 46, 9, 120,{size:16,weight:'Bold',color:C.primary,lh:22});\nawait icon(tabs,'9:13', 220, 14, 20, C.muted);\ntxt(tabs,'Pickup label','Pickup', 246, 13, 120,{size:16,color:C.muted,lh:22});\n\n// address field\nconst addr = frame(card,'Address field', 32, 104, 500, 72, '#F5F5F7', 14, true);\nawait icon(addr,'9:9', 20, 24, 24, C.primary);\ntxt(addr,'Address placeholder','Enter Your Address', 56, 22, 400,{size:17,color:C.muted,lh:26});\n\nconst findBtn = frame(card,'Find Food button', 548, 104, 280, 72, C.primary, 14, true);\nawait icon(findBtn,'9:12', 46, 24, 24, C.white);\ntxt(findBtn,'Find Food label','Find Food', 82, 22, 200,{size:18,weight:'Bold',color:C.white,lh:28});\n\n// warm under-strip\nrect(home,'Hero bottom tint', 0, 776, 1920, 0, null, 0);\n\npage.selection = [];\nreturn {loadedFonts: loaded, heroId: hero.id, card: card.id};\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":33325,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":33325}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"c56e8589-e23b-4b33-ad35-116e19209c8a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:40:34.411Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ZlPRfeCy8aTseE0kQNPveE","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
