{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrlk7gWquAAEJYaNPTI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why recoloring turns the map-marker and search icons into orange and white squares. The recolor sets fills on the instance root; that root fill is hidden, but forcing fills=[solid] with visible true produces the square, so recolor should touch only descendant strokes and fills, not the root.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":44796,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":44796}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"0dc9209b-9c90-42de-9bee-7cd8b5a06fef","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:42:04.428Z","thinking_duration_ms":8511}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrlk7gWquAAEJYaNPTI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Icons are stroke-based vectors, so recoloring must skip the instance root. Fixing that and softening the hero overlay."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":44796,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":44796}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"8da837ab-92f0-4109-a5e9-1bd6b0128f5a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:42:04.911Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNrlk7gWquAAEJYaNPTI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01kcidBzIraNw8qruY4SbcCT","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst U=globalThis.__U; const {C,solid,frame,txt}=U;\nfunction recolorTree(n,hex){\n  if(n.type==='VECTOR'||n.type==='BOOLEAN_OPERATION'||n.type==='ELLIPSE'||n.type==='RECTANGLE'){\n    if(n.strokes && n.strokes.length) n.strokes=[solid(hex)];\n    if(n.fills && n.fills.length && n.fills[0].visible!==false && n.fills[0].type==='SOLID') n.fills=[solid(hex)];\n  }\n  if(n.children) for(const c of n.children) recolorTree(c,hex);\n}\n// fix offending icons: find all instances whose names start with Icon_ in Hero & Header\nconst home=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:10');\nconst hero=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:30');\nlet fixed=0;\nconst targets=['13:37','13:34','13:35','13:36','13:21','13:13','13:15','13:17','13:20'];\nfunction getAll(n,acc){acc.push(n);if(n.children)for(const c of n.children)getAll(c,acc);return acc;}\nconst all=getAll(home,[]).filter(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&/^Icon_/.test(n.name));\nfor(const inst of all){\n  inst.fills=[]; // clear root fill\n  recolorTree(inst, inst.name==='Icon_Search'?'#FFFFFF':'#F17228');\n  // restore white for icons inside orange buttons\n  if(inst.parent && /Find Food button|Find Food label/.test(inst.parent.name)) recolorTree(inst,'#FFFFFF');\n  fixed++;\n}\n// delivery tab icon should be primary already; ensure pickup bag muted\nconst overlay=home.findOne(n=>n.name==='Hero overlay');\noverlay.fills=[{type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR',gradientTransform:[[1,0,0],[0,1,0]],gradientStops:[\n {position:0,color:{r:0.09,g:0.05,b:0.03,a:0.88}},\n {position:0.55,color:{r:0.30,g:0.14,b:0.03,a:0.55}},\n {position:1,color:{r:0.95,g:0.60,b:0.06,a:0.05}}]}];\nreturn {fixed, allIcons:all.length};\n","description":"Fix icon recoloring and hero overlay gradient","fileKey":"NE4meAES0ToaWiR2n9eVVf"},"caller"