{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNu7H5c3F28Gha53nX1a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Design is complete and audited. The page also confirms all fixed copy/data verbatim, with 125 media instances and no leftover sample cards.\n\nI've finished the FoodWagon landing page in your assigned file.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/NE4meAES0ToaWiR2n9eVVf/\n**Workspace page:** `03 · Workspace` — page ID `11:2`\n**Main screen:** `01_Home` — node ID `13:10` (1920 × 7586)\n\n**What's on the page, top to bottom**\n- **Header:** logo, deliver-to location, search field and Login, all with the supplied icons.\n- **Hero:** background photo with a warm gradient, circular noodle photo, \"Are you starving?\", Delivery/Pickup tabs with Delivery current, address field and Find Food.\n- **Best deals:** three promo cards with photo, title, copy and \"Proceed to order\".\n- **How does it work:** four numbered steps with icons and a connector line.\n- **Features:** Daily Discounts, Live Tracking, Quick Delivery.\n- **Popular items:** five item cards with carousel arrows.\n- **Daily discounts:** four discount cards with percent, dish and days remaining.\n- **Search by Food:** six circular category tiles with View All and arrows.\n- **Featured Restaurants:** eight cards with discount badge, Fast badge, initials mark, rating and open status, plus View All.\n- **CTA banner**, **App promo** with app mockup and store badges, and a **dark footer** with all city, company, contact and legal links, the newsletter field, social logos and copyright.\n\n**Component library** (page `11:2`, frame `02 · Components · FoodWagon UI kit`, node `16:15`)\n- Button with 4 types × 3 states (default, hover, disabled)\n- Text Field with 5 states, including focused and error\n- Badge set, Tab set (current, hover, disabled, pickup default)\n- Discount Card, Category Tile, four Step Cards, three Feature Items, Restaurant Card, Item Card, three Deal Cards, App Promo and CTA Banner\n- The page uses instances of these components rather than loose copies.\n\n**Prototype:** the brief states this is a single landing page with no links between frames and that every control is entry only, so no prototype connections were created. The required state design is handled visually: the Delivery tab is shown as current and the restaurant cards show both Open Now and Opens tomorrow.\n\n**Remaining limitations:** the frame is a single continuous scroll rather than separate screens, as specified. Hover states exist in the component library but are not wired as interactions, since the brief asks for no prototype flow.\n\n**Verification:** every section was screenshotted at least once and corrected where needed (section heights, photo crops, icon colours, card spacing). A text audit of the finished frame found all fixed copy, item prices, restaurant data, categories and all 24 cities present verbatim."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":148906,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":148906}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0f7ff31-013f-490f-95a5-726c8f36f404","uuid":"bd858de2-52d0-4b8d-baa7-b7208a96fb9f","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:11:50.419Z"}
